    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34046" root="فض" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ فَضْفَاضَةُ وَلَدِ أَبِيهِ</span></b> , accord. to Lth, means
<i>Such a one is the last of the children of his father;</i>
but Az says that the word known in this sense is
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَضْنَاضَة</span>, with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span>. (TA.)

